# Nethergoyf's power is the number of card types among cards in your graveyard, its toughness that plus one. Bot1's graveyard
# fills by Entomb: an Ornithopter (artifact and creature, two types) and an Island (land) join two Entombs (instant): four types,
# a 4/5 (an empty graveyard was a 0/1). Bot2's Entomb for a Wheel of Fortune on turn 2 puts an instant and a sorcery in
# Bot2's graveyard and changes nothing; a third Entomb for Demonic Tutor on turn 3 adds the sorcery type: a 5/6.

